caniuse-lite browser compatibility data (CC-BY-4.0) is used by development
tooling. The locked package's source URL and license are retained in
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt. stackback is also development-only; its MIT
metadata-based attribution supplement is identified in docs/licenses/.
The browser compatibility data source is https://caniuse.com/,
created and maintained by Alexis Deveria. The caniuse-lite package lists
Ben Briggs as author. OOS does not modify this upstream dataset.

